{
    "title": "Alien Invasion: RPG Idle Space",
    "description": "Spread your venom, defeat, evolve, and dominate in this addictive Alien Invasion: RPG idle survival game. Command an alien seeking supremacy, growing its army by eating every idle human. But beware \u2013 a powerful monster boss stands in your path, determined to halt your ascent. And you cannot kill it with fire, so you need to adapt and evolve your alien venom to triumph!\r\n\r\n\r\nDefeat for an eternal evolution: Become the ultimate alien overlord by defeating each idle human and evolving. Strengthen your spider alien's capacity, attack speed, and catching radius to devour foes more efficiently. Make sure there isn\u2019t a single survivor of your powerful venom!\r\n\r\nFace powerful bosses: Epic boss battles test your strategic skills. Only the strongest aliens survive and thrive. Can you emerge victorious while playing their survival games? This is the Alien Invasion: Idle RPG game and you are the main character - show them your full venom power!\r\n\r\nFight in epic battles: There is no alien isolation for you in your base. Different enemies plan a galaxy attack and come to find the alien, fearing its powerful monster evolution. Always upgrade your skills, grow your alien and catch them all - your mission will be rewarded!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\nEVOLVE your spider alien for new abilities and dominance.\r\nCRUSH waves of humans, challenge mighty monster bosses.\r\nUPGRADE capacity, speed, and radius for efficiency.\r\nCREATE your own army of spider alien monsters.\r\nPROGRESS through levels by completing quests.\r\nUNLOCK new locations and face untamed enemies.\r\nIMMERSE yourself in stunning visuals and sound.\r\n\r\n\r\nYou don\u2019t need to search for more alien games - find the alien power within you, defend your base against every enemy and come out as a victorious survivor!\r\nDominate or be defeated by the human crowd evolution \u2013 download Alien Invasion now, the only one of the survival RPG offline idle games you\u2019d endlessly enjoy, and assert extraterrestrial dominance!\r\n\r\nTo opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit our Privacy Policy: https://crazylabs.com/app",
    "descriptionHTML": "Spread your venom, defeat, evolve, and dominate in this addictive Alien Invasion: RPG idle survival game. Command an alien seeking supremacy, growing its army by eating every idle human. But beware \u2013 a powerful monster boss stands in your path, determined to halt your ascent. And you cannot kill it with fire, so you need to adapt and evolve your alien venom to triumph!<br><br><br>Defeat for an eternal evolution: Become the ultimate alien overlord by defeating each idle human and evolving. Strengthen your spider alien&#39;s capacity, attack speed, and catching radius to devour foes more efficiently. Make sure there isn\u2019t a single survivor of your powerful venom!<br><br>Face powerful bosses: Epic boss battles test your strategic skills. Only the strongest aliens survive and thrive. Can you emerge victorious while playing their survival games? This is the Alien Invasion: Idle RPG game and you are the main character - show them your full venom power!<br><br>Fight in epic battles: There is no alien isolation for you in your base. Different enemies plan a galaxy attack and come to find the alien, fearing its powerful monster evolution. Always upgrade your skills, grow your alien and catch them all - your mission will be rewarded!<br><br><br><br><br><br>FEATURES:<br>EVOLVE your spider alien for new abilities and dominance.<br>CRUSH waves of humans, challenge mighty monster bosses.<br>UPGRADE capacity, speed, and radius for efficiency.<br>CREATE your own army of spider alien monsters.<br>PROGRESS through levels by completing quests.<br>UNLOCK new locations and face untamed enemies.<br>IMMERSE yourself in stunning visuals and sound.<br><br><br>You don\u2019t need to search for more alien games - find the alien power within you, defend your base against every enemy and come out as a victorious survivor!<br>Dominate or be defeated by the human crowd evolution \u2013 download Alien Invasion now, the only one of the survival RPG offline idle gam